== G1: an office with no published record refuses every spawn

$ fm-spawn.sh ship firstmate (quartermaster, never published)
error: spawn refused: office quartermaster has no published authority record (/tmp/fm-office-gates.Tqdafw/quartermaster/config/office-authority with its receipt); the main home reports this with bin/fm-office.sh ensure and republishes the record with bin/fm-office.sh publish <id>

$ publish quartermaster
office quartermaster: pushed
[exit 0]

$ publish navigator
office navigator: pushed
[exit 0]

$ publish plain
office plain: unchanged
[exit 0]

$ ls -a plain/config
.
..
admission
== G2: published record: office-local admission edit (implicit sibling rules) is reported

$ ensure
OFFICE: office quartermaster: admission config fm in /tmp/fm-office-gates.Tqdafw/quartermaster/config differs from the master copy its record pins, so its merges of firstmate are refused; copy it again from /tmp/fm-office-gates.Tqdafw/main/config/admission
[exit 0]

$ ensure after restoring the master copy
[exit 0]
== G3: deleting one office signal refuses instead of falling back

$ fm-spawn.sh (.fm-office deleted)
error: spawn refused: /tmp/fm-office-gates.Tqdafw/quartermaster/data/charter.md has the "# Office authority" heading but this home has no .fm-office marker; the main home reports this with bin/fm-office.sh ensure and republishes the record with bin/fm-office.sh publish <id>

$ fm-spawn.sh (charter heading deleted)
error: spawn refused: this home has an .fm-office marker but /tmp/fm-office-gates.Tqdafw/quartermaster/data/charter.md lacks the "# Office authority" heading; the main home reports this with bin/fm-office.sh ensure and republishes the record with bin/fm-office.sh publish <id>
== G4: missing receipt and a record copied from another office refuse

$ fm-spawn.sh (receipt deleted)
error: spawn refused: office quartermaster has no published authority record (/tmp/fm-office-gates.Tqdafw/quartermaster/config/office-authority with its receipt); the main home reports this with bin/fm-office.sh ensure and republishes the record with bin/fm-office.sh publish <id>

$ fm-spawn.sh in navigator holding quartermaster's record
error: spawn refused: office navigator's authority record is unproven: the inherited office authority record diverges from the receipt; the main home reports this with bin/fm-office.sh ensure and republishes the record with bin/fm-office.sh publish <id>
== G5: a proven record enforces dispatch= and never creates a second mate

$ fm-spawn.sh in quartermaster for an undispatched project
error: spawn refused: office quartermaster dispatches only to firstmate (its authority record's dispatch=), not proj

$ fm-spawn.sh secondmate from quartermaster
error: spawn refused: office quartermaster never creates or relaunches a second mate
== G6: removing the office line revokes

$ publish navigator
office navigator: pushed - mirrored primary absence
[exit 0]

$ fm-spawn.sh in navigator after revocation
error: spawn refused: the main home published no authority for office navigator; the main home reports this with bin/fm-office.sh ensure and republishes the record with bin/fm-office.sh publish <id>
